file=People & Culture/merit/identity/README.md · i(e:identity/ (intentionally empty)=merit is a non-leader agent in the People & Culture department. Per playbook §6.1,\nnon-leader agents do NOT receive identity content — the department leader (hire) holds\nthe identity anchor for the whole department, and non-leaders tone-inherit through\ndepartment-leader inheritance.\n\nThe identity/ folder is present per §7.0a's rule that folder structure remains identical\nacross every agent even when a subfolder has no content. This README explains the\nintentional emptiness rather than leaving the folder silently blank.\n\nIf merit ever needs its own distinct identity anchor (a separate discussion, not\ninheritance), a persona doc would be added here per §6.2a rules.\n